@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml
title Executing an agreed reset
participant MishMash as App
participant ResetPlanCommand as Reset
participant ActiveMealPlan as Active
note over App, Reset
 Starts after agreement, or with no state to clear.
end note
App -> Reset : execute(recipeBook)
Reset -> Active : get(); getGroceryList()
Active --> Reset : previous presence
Reset -> Active : clear()
alt clear throws RuntimeException
 Reset --> App : throws MishMashException
else clear returns
 Reset -> Active : get(); getRequest(); getGroceryList()
 Active --> Reset : remaining state
 alt any state remains
  Reset --> App : throws MishMashException
 else all state cleared
  Reset --> App : reset or no-plan feedback
 end
end

@enduml
'@@author
